docs {
Cek versi release terbaru per platform (issue mobile#196). Publik, rate limit 30/menit.
Mobile memanggil ini saat start, bandingkan dengan PackageInfo.
Versi sama/lebih rendah dari build terpasang: klien skip diam (keputusan ada di klien).
200 (ada release):
{
"success": true,
"data": {
"id": "01J…",
"platform": "android",
"version": "0.2.0",
"store_url": "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.iamutaki.sambasku",
"notes": "Perbaikan bug",
"created_at": "2026-10-24T10:00:00.000Z",
"updated_at": "2026-10-24T11:00:00.000Z"
}
}
200 (belum ada): { "success": true, "data": null }
}
meta {
name: Get Mobile Release Latest
seq: 1
}
get {
url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mobile-release/latest?platform=android
body: none
}
tests {
test("status 200 + envelope", () => {
expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
});
}
